cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the paper below."
title: "Benchmarking Quantum Optimization for Microgrid Energy Dispatch"
type: software
license: MIT
version: 1.0.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/JannatulShorna12/Benchmarking-Quantum-Optimization-for-Microgrid-Energy-Dispatch"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and results for the NAPS 2026 paper "Benchmarking Quantum Optimization for
  Microgrid Energy Dispatch". Each rolling dispatch window of a battery microgrid is written
  as a 20-variable QUBO and solved with QAOA on IBM Kingston, quantum annealing on D-Wave
  Advantage2, the D-Wave Stride hybrid solver, exact enumeration and classical samplers,
  and compared with a MILP baseline on ARPA-E PERFORM ERCOT 2018 data. The repository
  rebuilds every table and figure of the paper from the stored runs and includes the 144
  window QUBOs as benchmark instances.
keywords:
  - quantum optimization
  - QAOA
  - quantum annealing
  - D-Wave
  - IBM Quantum
  - QUBO
  - microgrid
  - energy management
  - battery energy storage
  - MILP
  - benchmark
